Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: NixOS/mainline compatibility patches for 351v branch
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add missing #include <cstdint> for GCC 15 (4 files)
- Comment out dead go2/audio.h and drm_fourcc.h includes
- Fix GLES context: add SDL_GL_CONTEXT_PROFILE_ES, fix duplicate
  MAJOR_VERSION → MINOR_VERSION
- Resource path uses @out@ placeholder for Nix store injection
- FindSDL2MIXER.cmake uses @sdl2MixerDev@/@sdl2MixerLib@ placeholders
- CMakeLists.txt adds SDL2_mixer include via @sdl2MixerDev@ placeholder
